    "html_url": "https://github.com/nelsong6/shows/commit/d802a9dd7f4fb582911cec71d04585c52995fe7b",
    "message": "desktop: occlusion standby + skip render while minimized\n\nStop driving the video swapchain when the window is not visible (per DXGI\nguidance) to cut churn across focus/occlusion transitions, while investigating\nthe alt-tab monitor re-sync on the VRR/DSC display.\n\n- render(): on Present -\u003e DXGI_STATUS_OCCLUDED, enter standby; while in standby\n  only poll with DXGI_PRESENT_TEST (no draw/present/commit), resume when visible.\n- WM_TIMER: skip render entirely while IsIconic (minimized).\n- WM_ACTIVATE + standby enter/leave logged — instrumentation to correlate focus\n  changes with the re-sync on the affected hardware.\n- State: add standby: Cell\u003cbool\u003e.\n\nPhase 2 (suppress idle presents) deferred: needs an mpv render-update signal the\ncompositor does not expose. Phase 3 (allow-tearing) dropped: not applicable to a\nDWM-composited CreateSwapChainForComposition swapchain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOS5KECdoAKGQ4MDJhOWRkN2Y0ZmI1ODI5MTFjZWM3MWQwNDU4NWM1Mjk5NWZlN2I",
