    "html_url": "https://github.com/nelsong6/shows/commit/2189a91cec0a971957a037d4e4ea8a95a40c2209",
    "message": "DIAGNOSTIC (do not merge): freeze presentation in render()\n\nAction 1 of the alt-tab monitor re-sync investigation. Gates Present/Commit\nbehind FREEZE_PRESENTATION=true so the render loop issues no presentation while\nthe build runs (on-screen frame frozen). Isolates whether the present loop\ndrives the flash: if the re-sync persists with zero presents, the present loop\nis not the cause and the transition is DWM/driver-level. Revert after observation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOS5KECdoAKDIxODlhOTFjZWMwYTk3MTk1N2EwMzdkNGU0ZWE4YTk1YTQwYzIyMDk",
