    "html_url": "https://github.com/nelsong6/shows/commit/c02e564449715c3e2f78d0b4d4096ae5b8b01af0",
    "message": "desktop: gate presentation on focus (Action 2; supersedes freeze diagnostic)\n\nRevert the freeze-presentation diagnostic (a null result there was dubious: with\nno video there is no trigger). Instead present only while the window is focused;\nwhile defocused, render() issues no Present/Commit and the frame freezes until\nrefocus, with normal playback when focused.\n\nTests whether presenting through a focus change drives the alt-tab monitor\nre-sync, while keeping video playing so the triggering conditions still exist.\n\n- State: add focused: Cell\u003cbool\u003e (init true).\n- render(): early-return when not focused.\n- WM_ACTIVATE: set focused from activation state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
