    "html_url": "https://github.com/nelsong6/shows/commit/65f9d41f1d505429641cd1b9eeedf53c26d0e3af",
    "message": "desktop: revert focus-gating; restore standby-only presentation\n\nFocus-gating (c02e564) did not resolve the alt-tab monitor re-sync — the flash\nwas observed with no presents during defocus — and it freezes defocused video,\nwhich is undesirable to ship. Restore the standby-only render loop (the spec-\ngrounded occlusion handling) plus the WM_ACTIVATE focus-transition logging.\n\nDetermination: the re-sync is DWM's focus-driven switch of the window swapchain\nbetween Composed (unfocused) and Independent-Flip/MPO direct-scanout (focused),\nwhich re-trains the VRR/DSC link. DWM owns that decision; the composition-\nswapchain API exposes no supported \"always composed\" control. Documented\nmitigations are system-side (DWM MPO disable / NVCP G-Sync fullscreen-only) and\nare out of scope. Not fixable in-app without a large, unverifiable rearchitecture\noff the DWM-composited flip-swapchain model.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOS5KECdoAKDY1ZjlkNDFmMWQ1MDU0Mjk2NDFjZDFiOWVlZWRmNTNjMjZkMGUzYWY",
