    "html_url": "https://github.com/nelsong6/shows/commit/af8a395dd85b1b21f7a8a67196a612a81caa66bb",
    "message": "desktop: force video plane to Composed via sub-unity opacity (flash candidate)\n\nApply a DComp opacity effect (0.99) to the video visual so DWM must\nalpha-blend it, making the swapchain ineligible for the independent-flip /\nMPO scanout path. PresentMon recorded the video swapchain churning between\n\"Composed: Flip\" and \"Hardware Composed: Independent Flip\" across focus\nedges; that present-mode promotion/demotion is the candidate trigger for the\nVRR+DSC display-link re-train (\"flash\") on alt-tab. Pinning the plane to\nComposed removes the churn.\n\nCandidate fix under objective grading (PresentMon must show zero Independent\nFlip frames even when focused). 1% transparency is a test artifact to be\nrefined to a no-op filter effect if the mechanism is confirmed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
