    "message": "desktop: add flash observability (event log + heartbeat + Ctrl+Alt+F marker)\n\nInstrument the monitor-flash investigation instead of chasing one-shot\nrepros. To %APPDATA%\\shows\\shows.log (prefix \"OBS \"):\n- WM_DISPLAYCHANGE  -\u003e automatic marker if the flash is a modeset\n- WM_ACTIVATE / WM_ACTIVATEAPP -\u003e focus-edge transitions + other window class\n- ~1Hz heartbeat -\u003e foreground window class, on_top/fullscreen/standby, size\n- global Ctrl+Alt+F hotkey -\u003e user-stamped flash marker (works backgrounded)\n\nPairs with a continuous system-wide PresentMon capture + a resource monitor\n(WS/handles/GDI growth) to catch the uptime-correlated, intermittent event.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
