    "html_url": "https://github.com/nelsong6/shows/commit/26c469613e975e2d99d92692819e2bd3d99e8ece",
    "message": "desktop: revert force-composed video opacity (ADR-0003)\n\nThe 0.99 DComp opacity on the video visual (ADR-0002) let ~1% of the desktop\nbleed through the video over the transparent host window — a visible regression\n— and does not fix the actual flash: that occurs when shows is PINNED, where the\nvideo is already stably Composed yet still flashes, so pinning its own plane to\nComposed changes nothing. Remove the effect entirely; video is opaque again.\nObservability rig (event log + PresentMon + Ctrl+Alt+F marker) is unaffected and\ncontinues the investigation. Supersede ADR-0002 with ADR-0003; drop the\nshell-contract note.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOS5KECdoAKDI2YzQ2OTYxM2U5NzVlMmQ5OWQ5MjY5MjgxOWUyYmQzZDk5ZThlY2U",
