    "html_url": "https://github.com/nelsong6/shows/commit/ae50ec4e5e09dbe57e604b85ec25c54ef9629098",
    "message": "desktop: keep Present/Commit per-tick, gate only mpv re-render (fix pin regression)\n\nThe leak-fix gated the video Present behind \"new frame\", but the WebView2\noverlay's repaints are coupled to the per-tick present (shell contract warns of\nthis). So while the video was paused, overlay updates stranded — the titlebar\ndidn't reappear on unpin and the pin button looked unresponsive (the \"pin broken\nat random times\" regression). Gate ONLY s.gl.render() (the actual ~18MB/min\nleak from re-rendering the same frame); keep CopyResource + Present + Commit\nevery tick exactly like the known-good build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOS5KECdoAKGFlNTBlYzRlNWUwOWRiZTU3ZTYwNGI4NWVjMjVjNTRlZjk2MjkwOTg",
